<title>USA: Veeco sees Q2 acquisition charge.</title>
<headline>Veeco sees Q2 acquisition charge.</headline>
<dateline>PLAINVIEW, N.Y. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Veeco Instruments Inc said Thursday it expects to take a one-time pre-tax charge in the second quarter of $3.5 to $4.5 million ($0.35 to $0.45 per share after-tax) in connection with the acquisition of certain assets and personnel of the Media and Magnetics Applications division of Materials Research Corp.</p>
<p>Veeco said it had completed the acquisition. It said it paid cash and assumed certain liabilities. It not disclose the value of the deal.</p>
<p>Materials Research is a unit of Sony Corp.</p>
